# Amap (高德地图) — optional.
#
# Without these the app keeps using the Leaflet / OpenStreetMap map, which
# works fine; Amap is what gives you the real YNU buildings, footpaths,
# dormitory names and POI search, which OpenStreetMap does not have for
# Chinese campuses.
#
# To get them:
#   1. Register at https://lbs.amap.com (needs a Chinese phone number and
#      real-name verification — only the account owner can do this).
#   2. 控制台 → 应用管理 → 我的应用 → 创建新应用 → 添加 Key
#   3. Choose service type "Web端(JS API)".
#   4. Copy the Key and the 安全密钥 (security code) below.
#   5. In the same console, restrict the key to your own domain.
#
# Both values ship inside the built JavaScript — that is how Amap's browser
# API works. The domain restriction in step 5 is the actual protection, not
# secrecy, so do not skip it.
VITE_AMAP_KEY=
VITE_AMAP_SECURITY_CODE=

# Optional: override the Leaflet tile source (used only when Amap is off).
# VITE_MAP_TILE_URL=
# VITE_MAP_TILE_ATTRIBUTION=
